Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A contractor sends Ahlsell a pack of drawings\Nand asks what the fittings will cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The customer wants a clear request.\NThe specialist must sign off on the take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Today that answer is still done by hand.\NThey open drawing after drawing and start from a blank page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes hours — and if they miss a single room,\Nthe quote is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:01:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the first pass was not a blank page?\NThe AI drafts the markup so they do not start from zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They check that draft, verify it,\Nand add or remove whatever is needed. Then they sign off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The work is faster, and they can be more confident.\NA person is still accountable.
